msgid "Deposit amount"
msgstr "Importo acconto"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:106
#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:459
msgid "General settings"
msgstr "Impostazioni generali"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:113
msgid "Enable deposits"
msgstr "Abilita acconti"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:120
msgid "Allow store-wide deposit features."
msgstr "Consenti le funzionalita di acconto a livello globale."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:126
msgid "Require login"
msgstr "Richiedi accesso"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:133
msgid "Restrict deposit purchases to authenticated customers."
msgstr "Limita gli acquisti con acconto ai clienti autenticati."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:139
msgid "Deposit type"
msgstr "Tipo di acconto"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:150
msgid ""
"Defines whether the default deposit is calculated as a percentage or a fixed "
"amount."
msgstr ""
"Definisce se l'acconto predefinito viene calcolato come percentuale o come "
"importo fisso."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:165
msgid "Default global amount used when no product-level rule is present."
msgstr ""
"Importo globale predefinito usato quando non e presente una regola a livello "
"prodotto."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:171
msgid "Default selection"
msgstr "Scelta predefinita"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:180
msgid "Pay in full"
msgstr "Paga per intero"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:187
msgid "Order fully paid status"
msgstr "Stato ordine completamente pagato"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:200
msgid "Disabled payment gateways"
msgstr "Gateway di pagamento disabilitati"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:208
msgid "Gateways selected here will be excluded when a deposit flow is active."
msgstr ""
"I gateway selezionati qui verranno esclusi quando e attivo un flusso con "
"acconto."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:214
msgid "Balance due in days"
msgstr "Scadenza saldo in giorni"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:223
msgid ""
"Defines how many days the customer has to pay the remaining balance after "
"the deposit order is paid."
msgstr ""
"Definisce quanti giorni ha il cliente per pagare il saldo residuo dopo il "
"pagamento dell'ordine con acconto."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:229
msgid "Send balance reminders"
msgstr "Invia promemoria saldo"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:236
msgid "Send an automatic reminder email before the balance due date."
msgstr ""
"Invia automaticamente un'email di promemoria prima della data di scadenza "
"del saldo."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:242
msgid "Reminder lead time"
msgstr "Anticipo promemoria"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:251
msgid ""
"Number of days before the due date when the reminder email should be sent. "
"Use 0 to remind on the due date itself."
msgstr ""
"Numero di giorni prima della data di scadenza in cui deve essere inviata "
"l'email di promemoria. Usa 0 per ricordarlo nel giorno stesso della scadenza."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:257
msgid "Tax handling"
msgstr "Gestione tasse"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:265
msgid "Charge taxes proportionally with the deposit"
msgstr "Addebita le tasse in proporzione all'acconto"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:267
msgid ""
"This release keeps product taxes proportional to the portion paid today and "
"tracks the remaining tax balance separately."
msgstr ""
"Questa release mantiene le tasse prodotto proporzionali alla quota pagata "
"oggi e traccia separatamente il saldo residuo delle tasse."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:273
msgid "Shipping handling"
msgstr "Gestione spedizione"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:281
msgid "Charge full shipping with the initial payment"
msgstr "Addebita l'intera spedizione con il pagamento iniziale"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:282
msgid "Split shipping proportionally with the deposit"
msgstr "Ripartisci la spedizione in proporzione all'acconto"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:284
msgid ""
"Use proportional shipping when you want the customer to pay only part of the "
"shipping amount today and defer the rest with the balance."
msgstr ""
"Usa la spedizione proporzionale quando vuoi che il cliente paghi oggi solo "
"una parte della spedizione e rinvii il resto insieme al saldo."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:290
msgid "Coupon handling"
msgstr "Gestione coupon"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:298
msgid "Allow coupons on the initial payment only"
msgstr "Consenti i coupon solo sul pagamento iniziale"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:299
msgid "Exclude deposit items from coupons"
msgstr "Escludi dai coupon gli articoli con acconto"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:301
msgid ""
"The default policy lets WooCommerce discounts affect the amount paid today, "
"while the remaining balance keeps its own tracked amount."
msgstr ""
"La policy predefinita consente agli sconti WooCommerce di influire "
"sull'importo pagato oggi, mentre il saldo residuo mantiene il proprio "
"importo tracciato."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:307
msgid "Deposit selection"
msgstr "Selezione acconto"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:314
msgid "Pay deposit text"
msgstr "Testo paga acconto"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:326
msgid "Pay full amount text"
msgstr "Testo paga importo completo"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:338
msgid "Deposit text"
msgstr "Testo acconto"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:350
msgid "Checkout and order"
msgstr "Checkout e ordine"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:357
msgid "To pay text"
msgstr "Testo da pagare"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:369
msgid "Future payments text"
msgstr "Testo pagamenti futuri"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:381
msgid "Deposit amount text"
msgstr "Testo importo acconto"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:455
msgid ""
"Current milestone adds deposit settings, product overrides, classic checkout "
"calculations, linked balance orders, customer balance emails, reminders, and "
"My Account balance payment actions. Cart and Checkout Blocks integration is "
"planned for a future release."
msgstr ""
"Questa milestone aggiunge impostazioni acconti, override prodotto, calcoli "
"per il checkout classico, ordini saldo collegati, email cliente per il "
"saldo, promemoria e azioni di pagamento saldo in My Account. L'integrazione "
"con Cart e Checkout Blocks e prevista in una release futura."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:457
msgid "Settings tabs"
msgstr "Schede impostazioni"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:462
msgid "Labels & text"
msgstr "Etichette e testi"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:475
msgid "Save changes"
msgstr "Salva modifiche"

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:485
msgid ""
"Start with sensible store-wide defaults. Product, category, cart, "
"installment, and balance collection rules will build on top of these "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Inizia con impostazioni globali ragionevoli. Regole di prodotto, categoria, "
"carrello, rate e incasso saldo si baseranno su queste impostazioni."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:492
msgid ""
"Customize the labels customers will see when choosing between a deposit and "
"a full payment."
msgstr ""
"Personalizza le etichette che i clienti vedranno quando scelgono tra un "
"acconto e il pagamento completo."

#: /Applications/MAMP/htdocs/wp-plugins/plugins/datrooster-partial-payments/src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:499
msgid ""
"These strings are used around the order summary and future balance "
"communication."
msgstr ""
"Queste stringhe vengono usate nel riepilogo ordine e nelle future "
"comunicazioni relative al saldo."

